Hunch
Copyright 2026 Hunch contributors (https://github.com/heed-build/hunch)

Hunch is a fork of laya-mlx-swift (https://github.com/MstyAI/laya-mlx-swift),
revision 353ba75d4ee377a0b23eb863470884cd154108de, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The notice above is laya-mlx-swift's and is kept as published. Files Hunch
changed carry a notice saying so at the top.

Hunch runs Laya checkpoints. It downloads them from the origin repositories
published by Convai Innovations on Hugging Face (convaiinnovations/laya and
convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual, Apache-2.0) at pinned revisions, instead of
from aac6fef/laya-mlx as stated above. Hunch does not include or redistribute
model weights or tokenizer files. "Laya" names the checkpoints Hunch runs; Hunch
is not affiliated with or endorsed by Convai Innovations or the Laya project.

The parity fixtures in Tests/HunchTests/Fixtures/parity-*.json hold requests
built from laya-mlx's parity cases and examples, and answers recorded by
running laya-mlx (https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx, Apache-2.0). The
calibration format, temperature clamp and terminal-text findings follow laya-mlx
and Laya. laya-mlx's notice:

